{'symbol': 'IFF', 'date': '2022-07-05 09:00:00', 'title': 'IFF APPOINTS NICOLAS GEBARA AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, COMMERCIAL AND FLAVORS', 'text': 'COMPANY ADJUSTS ORGANIZATIONAL STRUCTURE IN THE NOURISH DIVISION TO ENHANCE CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE NEW YORK , JULY 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IFF (NYSE: IFF) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT NICOLAS GEBARA HAS BEEN NAMED SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, COMMERCIAL AND FLAVORS, NOURISH, EFFECTIVE JULY 1, 2022. IN HIS 23 YEARS AT IFF, GEBARA HAS HELD VARIOUS ROLES, MOST RECENTLY SERVING AS VICE PRESIDENT, NORTH AMERICA FOR NOURISH.'}